#Project.
##A collage is providing a range of student support services, such as academic support, careers advice, learning support and other student services.
##Currently, students may contact services by email or by phone, while staff use calenders, spreadsheets and other informal methods to manage appointments.
##The collage wants to investigate a software system that could make appointment management easier.
##Problems currenly happening are:
##-Students are sometimes unsure which service they should contact.
##-Students may not know when appointments are available. 
##-Staff spend time managing appointments manually.
##-Cancellations and changes can be difficult to manage
##-Different staff may have different appointment types and availability 

#Stakeholders:
##-Students
##-Staff
##-Collage

#Needs:
##Services for students to contact need to be clearly shown on the system.
##Whether we need to transfer the pervious appointments to the system or they wont use the system until all the previous appointments are finished is unclear.
##System should automate managing appointments so that Staff shouldent need to manage them manually.
##Staff need to be asked about their different appointment types and availability for the system.

#Goals
##Help reduce unsureness for students about services.
##Help reduce additional workload for staff.
##Make changes or cancellation easier to manage.

Scope:


Assumptions:
That all users have access to wifi.
That the collage has a plan for the transfer to the new system if they are implamenting the system before all the appointments are done.
That we will be shown the contact info for the services for students.

Unknowns:
If the collage wants to transfer the appointments to the system or wait until all appoints are finished to implaemnt the new system.
if the system needs a login to access or not.
if there needs to be diffent login types for diffent users, aka staff and students.
if the staff need to check the system to see appointments for them or are sent an email.


Requirements:
The system shall display appointment slots from lecterers that are currently available. *
The system shall stop the need for staff to manually adjust the appointments by managing the appointments. 
The system will protect info about students and appointments by making it not accessable to users who are not the students or lecurer. 
The system shall take given a appointment and will add them to that lectuers appointments secudule. *
The system shall record date of time of appointments. *
The system shall allow students to manage their appointments by creating, updating and canceling their appointments. *
The system shall allow lectures to manage, create, update their appointment slots and confirm appointments. *
The system shall send an automated email to both students and lectures of approved meeting.
The system shall allow admin to manage students and lectuers to the system. *
The system shall allow admins to proform adminatraive tasks, how many sessions have occured in weeks or months. *
The system shall display info such as the contact info for student services and appointment in a tidy display with no other info obsuring each other.
The system shall allow admins to scroll throw student and lectuer lists. *

Quality requirments:
Security:
Security is very important for a booking system, as it contains senstive information such as users names and emails as well as location they are planning to be at a certain time.
If security was implamented, people could also take people off of the system via admin, making them unable to use the system.
Privacy: 
Privacy is important as it shares simular concerns as secuity does. it prevents students from seeing each others appointments which contains their id's and times as well as what they need support in, 
which for some could be very private for them and not what people to see.
Accessibility:
Many people will be using this system, so the system has to be able to accomdate all of their disabilties and other factors like language so they all access it.

